{
  "_comment": [
    "The marker environments every package's materialization digest is computed",
    "for. Explicit, because a digest derived from whatever interpreter happened",
    "to run is not reproducible off that machine.",
    "Linux targets manylinux_2_28, also the cloud base-image floor; macOS",
    "targets macosx_14_0.",
    "Changing this file re-pins every package at once, which is exactly why it",
    "is a committed artifact and not a runtime default."
  ],
